{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1058122/block/singleImage/3236679/df/1613483089_XT.JPG?updatedAt=1791858353\"/><figcaption>炮台山住宅遇竊失40萬元珠寶，警拘33歲菲傭。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>昨日 (12 日 ) 下午 5 時 19 分，一名 65 歲姓黃婦人發現家中一批值約 40 萬元的珠寶不翼而飛，懷疑被人盜去，其丈夫代為報案。 事發於炮台山道 32 號富澤花園一單位，人員接報到場，經初步調查，一名 33 歲菲律賓籍女傭涉嫌「盜竊」被捕，她現正被扣留調查。據悉，被捕人持有香港身份證。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-13T03:21:54.192275+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":180,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T02:25:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T04:37:56.470324+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-13T03:18:09.654630+00:00","content_hash":"875f8d5a7d9c6f3e82b0b2b00405bc7d640398a300f0b4a26318411864e8af30","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}